WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.340
Hello, I'm Enzo, from CS BTP.
I'm a young contractor,

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:08.900
I took on the build of a house.
Since I lack experience with the system,

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:12.780
I chose Polistibrick
because its simplicity won me over.

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:17.200
I built my first house with it,
I'm very pleased and I do recommend it.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.600
Don't hesitate —
with or without experience.
